      "review_description": "I wanted to put solar on a small rental property (1BR) in Vic and decided to go with ERG Energy.I was happy with their price and offered solution, 9 panels (3.96kW) all oriented north.I took advantage of the Victorian government scheme that provided a $1400 rebate on the install on a rental.This did cause a little delay in waiting for this to be approved, and it was only approved just before Christmas so install ended up the new year.There was a another few days delay in installation due to staff illness but then was installed.  Very happy with installation and service. Was up one day and approved and operational the next day.  The installationLooking at the monitoring, the system is generating significantly more than the consumption, so hopefully in Winter it will still be generating a worthwhile contribution.My tenant who is on a pension seems very happy with the system.",
